message: "If you use ThermoGPU in research or technical work, please cite the software."
title: "ThermoGPU"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Myers"
    given-names: "Richard"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-29
url: "https://github.com/rdm375/ThermoGPU"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rdm375/ThermoGPU"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  ThermoGPU is a validated C++/OpenMP/CUDA implementation of the
  Peng-Robinson equation of state for batched single-phase,
  multicomponent thermodynamic calculations, with CPU/GPU
  differential validation and performance characterization.
keywords:
  - Peng-Robinson
  - equation of state
  - thermodynamics
  - CUDA
  - OpenMP
  - scientific computing
  - GPU computing
